WEBVTT

00:01:39.170 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>This remote tropical island 
is known only to a select few</i>

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:45.760
<i>and completely unknown to 
those unfamiliar with it.</i>

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:49.510
<i>The last paradise on earth, 
not found on any map.</i>

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:51.290
<i>Unbaba Island.</i>

00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:03.280
<i>This heavenly sight would 
excite anyone, not just men.</i>

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:11.040
<i>Unbaba Island is the site of the 
Blood Donation Club's training camp.</i>

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:15.570
<i>The midsummer sun, blue seas, white beaches,</i>

00:02:15.570 --> 00:02:20.690
<i>and beautiful young women clad in swimwear 
essential to any summer seaside.</i>

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:26.460
<i>Though there are some oddballs present, too.</i>

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:30.290
<i>And some we could've done without.</i>

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:33.640
<i>And creepy ones.</i>

00:02:34.190 --> 00:02:42.350
<i>However, either way, the Blood Donation Club 
has this marvelous beach all to itself.</i>

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:49.320
<i>Our path to this intoxicating world 
started with a certain website...</i>

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:53.480
<b>School Infirmary</b>

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:53.480
<b>Blood Donation Club (Temp)</b>

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:53.470
A training camp?

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:55.190
Yes, ma'am.

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:58.770
A Blood Donation Club's training camp?

00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:01.970
Are you going to train with syringes?

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:06.150
You need government 
certification to use these.

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:11.020
Find the vein beneath the skin, 
take aim, and plunge it in.

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:13.310
Stimpak!

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:18.550
Rather, gently slide the needle in.

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:21.550
Words can't describe that moment of bliss.

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:25.380
Did you think a bunch of high school 
students would get to do that, you fools?

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:27.380
That's not what I had in mind.

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:29.800
Doctor, a club training camp...

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:31.730
Takes place on a summer beach in Okinawa.

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:33.310
Club members dress in swimwear...

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:36.100
...and enjoy good clean fun 
with the opposite sex.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:39.200
I'll kick you brutes out of the club!

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:41.720
Again, that's not what I had in mind.

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:43.090
Once night falls...

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:44.670
We'll party and drink beer.

00:03:44.670 --> 00:03:46.260
And have fun horsing around.

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:48.710
Not that.

00:03:48.710 --> 00:03:50.680
We'll enjoy discussing our youth.

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:53.670
And deepen our friendship through 
cheerful club activities.

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:59.050
In other words, you want to 
go on a trip and cut loose.

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:00.450
Exactly.

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:01.570
Fools!

00:04:03.070 --> 00:04:06.070
We don't have the budget for that.

00:04:06.070 --> 00:04:08.980
We were just barely able to 
establish a night school.

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:12.810
Not only that, but the school 
hasn't given a single cent

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:16.650
to this educationally useless 
Blood Donation Club.

00:04:22.230 --> 00:04:26.700
You're not listening!

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:31.290
Tours

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:39.170
<b>CTC </b>The Chimidoro travel company that supports your travels

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:39.170
Currently Running Campaign

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:39.170
Recommendations

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:31.120
Well, if it isn't a travel agency website.

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:34.960
I've been trying to tell you that 
Kaoru found us a good deal.

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:38.080
Now's your chance, miss.

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:39.180
Click.

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:51.770
Tropical Deserted Island

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:42.880
A tropical dessert island?

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:43.950
"Deserted" island, you idiot.

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:45.750
Can't you read?

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:51.770
Paradise by the Sea

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:48.400
Paradise by the See?

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:49.550
Wrong "sea."

00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:51.760
Could you stop making jokes that don't 
make sense without onscreen text?

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:56.100
<b>Life</b>

00:04:52.070 --> 00:04:53.900
Wash away your life's troubles.

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:56.100
The whole thing, all at once.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:59.020
One week on an unmapped desert island.

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:03.270
All meals are covered at a rate 
of 10,000 yen per person.

00:05:03.270 --> 00:05:06.400
First come, first served. 
Limited to first 12 customers.

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:08.220
Campaign running now.

00:05:08.220 --> 00:05:13.020
That's cheap. Or rather, super cheap. 
No, insanely cheap.

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:13.780
Right?

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:16.410
I'm definitely going.

00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:17.360
I'm going.

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:19.750
I'd be willing to visit a tropical island.

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:24.060
I'll be coming along for the Cinema Club's 
first overseas on-location shoot.

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:27.770
Men and women camping together on a 
tropical island is a potential minefield.

00:05:27.770 --> 00:05:30.010
I'll keep close watch over everyone.

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:37.690
<b>Tongue</b>

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:32.120
The only thing to do is go.

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:34.500
You're coming, too?

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:36.390
Monsters can't come.

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:38.230
Don't discriminate.

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:39.580
Shut up, all of you.

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:41.540
It goes without saying that the club advisor

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:43.930
is required to participate 
in any training camps.

00:05:43.930 --> 00:05:46.150
I'll have to join you, as well.

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:48.190
Yeah!

00:05:48.190 --> 00:05:52.210
<i>And that's how we wasted no time 
planning our training camp.</i>

00:05:52.650 --> 00:05:57.550
<i>Perhaps we should've noticed at this point 
that there was reason it was so cheap,</i>

00:05:57.550 --> 00:06:03.330
<i>and that Heaven and Hell were just 
one step away from each other.</i>

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:16.010
Since it was such a cheap package, 
I wasn't expecting a direct flight...

00:06:16.010 --> 00:06:21.380
But we've been traveling in reverse in the hold 
of a less than 50-ton converted fishing vessel.

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:24.400
It takes three days and 
two nights to get there.

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:27.900
Which means it'll also take three 
days and two nights to get back.

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:32.600
Then our stay on the island will 
only two days and one night.

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:34.810
The only thing to do is puke.

00:06:42.620 --> 00:06:50.210
However, once we arrived, it was 
undoubtedly a blissful paradise.

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:58.020
Nice. Very nice.

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:02.140
I'm impressed by this 4K 240FPS HS camera.

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:06.110
Mai, we're heading back.

00:07:06.350 --> 00:07:11.740
No matter how well we protect you from 
UV rays, they're still not good for you.

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:13.250
Okay.

00:07:14.110 --> 00:07:17.640
I'm going for another swim.

00:07:18.550 --> 00:07:21.870
<i>Leaving the Okinawan fisherman's 
daughter Nami behind,</i>

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:24.410
<i>we headed back to our lodgings.</i>

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:30.610
<i>We had no idea that this would 
lead to that tragedy later.</i>

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:34.680
<b>Fishman</b>

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:38.800
<i>However, there wasn't a shred of fantasy 
or hope to be found at our lodgings</i>

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:40.980
<i>that dragged us back to reality.</i>

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:46.600
Welcome.

00:07:49.810 --> 00:07:54.990
Please make yourselves at home.

00:07:55.840 --> 00:08:00.340
Um, what about the crowds of 
beautiful women you advertised?

00:08:00.340 --> 00:08:03.650
That's next month's campaign.

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:05.310
Which means...

00:08:05.310 --> 00:08:07.230
This inn...

00:08:07.230 --> 00:08:11.650
Indeed. I barely manage 
to run this place myself.

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:15.610
There's a long sad history.

00:08:15.610 --> 00:08:18.110
Okay, okay. Spare us the history lesson.

00:08:18.110 --> 00:08:21.670
It's almost refreshing 
to be this disappointed.

00:08:21.670 --> 00:08:22.690
Right, guys?

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:24.560
How is this refreshing?

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:26.520
Who's going to take responsibility for this?

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:28.360
You guys were so excited earlier.

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:31.200
I knew it sounded too good to be true.

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:33.380
It only cost 10,000 yen. Just give it up.

00:08:33.380 --> 00:08:35.820
No way. I paid an entire 
10,000 yen for this.

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:40.460
In this day and age, living without a shower, 
refrigerator, or TV is a valuable experience.

00:08:40.460 --> 00:08:41.820
Are you crying?

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:45.720
Now that I get a closer look, this place 
does have a certain rare charm to it.

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:50.270
Exactly. As long as we're here, 
let's enjoy ourselves to the fullest extent.

00:08:50.580 --> 00:08:54.290
By the way, you minors will be 
drinking Pepchi and castor oil.

00:08:54.290 --> 00:08:56.590
We follow the broadcast code on this show.

00:08:56.590 --> 00:08:58.600
<b>Self-censored</b>

00:09:04.930 --> 00:09:10.470
Anyway, why are we the only guests here 
when you've got that marvelous beach?

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:14.650
There's a lot of reasons for that.

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:19.760
Anyway, I'll let you know 
once dinner is ready.

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:25.690
My tongue!

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:32.300
Charging

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:36.500
Anyway...

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:38.520
Nami's still not here.

00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:41.590
I doubt Nami of all people drowned.

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:45.380
We didn't see anyone on the beach.

00:09:45.380 --> 00:09:47.600
But we did find this.

00:09:50.010 --> 00:09:52.070
She went skinny dipping in the sea at night?

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:54.680
It's the sea at night that 
makes skinny dipping possible.

00:09:54.680 --> 00:09:56.600
So bold.

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:58.400
Let's go look for her.

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:01.270
It's obvious what your ulterior motive is!

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:05.090
This might be a serious situation.

00:10:05.090 --> 00:10:06.960
She may be a fisherman's daughter,

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:10.160
but it's hard to imagine Nami 
would do something so dangerous.

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:11.710
Did a shark get her?

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:15.490
Jaws? No, Jason?

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:19.420
Could it be?!

00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:24.470
Please don't suddenly show up like that!

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:27.620
I hate to think that's what happened, but...

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:31.120
Ma'am, is there something on that beach?

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:35.760
He shows up once every 
decade during hot summers.

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:38.330
It could be him.

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:39.380
Could it be?

00:10:39.670 --> 00:10:41.220
The Predator.

00:10:41.610 --> 00:10:44.360
Stop making jokes that 
will get us in trouble.

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:50.930
It happened about 500 years ago.

00:10:50.930 --> 00:10:54.270
In an impoverished fishing 
village on the island,

00:10:54.270 --> 00:11:00.330
there was an astonishingly beautiful girl.

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:08.340
She refused to listen to any of the 
numerous marriage proposals made to her.

00:11:08.340 --> 00:11:14.020
Day after day, she dove into 
the sea to support her family.

00:11:14.330 --> 00:11:18.710
And one day, at the bottom of the sea...

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:21.260
...something grabbed her!

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:25.570
Grabbed her? She was eaten?

00:11:25.570 --> 00:11:27.170
Grabbed...

00:11:27.690 --> 00:11:31.290
...her heart! Falling in love!

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:40.330
He was a strapping young man, but he was 
neither a villager nor a fisherman.

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:41.760
Not only that, but...

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:46.830
...he wasn't even human!

00:11:47.340 --> 00:11:50.120
Could we stop with the sudden close-ups?

00:11:50.490 --> 00:11:53.060
Ma'am, please continue.

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:58.110
They spent what little time they had 
together while the girl's breath lasted,

00:11:58.110 --> 00:12:01.060
but alas, she was only human.

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:06.130
On top of that, the seaweed wrapped around 
them blocked the young man from view.

00:12:06.130 --> 00:12:09.080
Overcome with grief, 
the girl said the following.

00:12:09.990 --> 00:12:15.650
"Meet me on the beach at night. 
I want to get a good look at you."

00:12:15.980 --> 00:12:20.060
"Won't you please come see me?"

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:27.100
The creature that came to meet the 
girl waiting on the deserted beach

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:32.080
was horrifying in appearance.

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:35.770
<b><b>He Was a Fishman</b></b>

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:48.450
Since then, on hot summer nights,

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:52.750
a horrifying fishman appears 
to kidnap beautiful girls

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:55.380
and drag them to the bottom of the sea.

00:12:55.860 --> 00:13:00.170
Hot summers? When's the 
last time he appeared?

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:02.440
It was hot last year, as well.

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:05.100
And the year before that, 
and the year before that.

00:13:05.100 --> 00:13:06.210
That's every year.

00:13:06.210 --> 00:13:08.640
Indeed. He comes every year.

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:11.330
Didn't you say earlier that 
he comes once every decade?

00:13:11.330 --> 00:13:14.780
I'm old. I'm not very good 
with numbers anymore.

00:13:14.780 --> 00:13:16.780
Come on, you're not Daijiro Morohoshi.

00:13:16.780 --> 00:13:19.370
And this isn't a Hollywood 
B-movie horror film.

00:13:19.370 --> 00:13:22.660
What are you talking about, 
bunnies with bright red eyes?

00:13:22.660 --> 00:13:25.130
<i>Creature from the Black Lagoon</i> is a masterpiece.

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:28.380
Its sequel <i>Revenge of the Creature</i> aside,

00:13:28.380 --> 00:13:32.360
the underwater scenes and creature 
costume are incredible.

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:33.780
She's doing it again.

00:13:33.780 --> 00:13:36.610
The fishmen in <i>The Terror Beneath 
the Sea</i> were good, too.

00:13:36.610 --> 00:13:39.670
You can't discuss <i>The Terror Beneath the Sea</i>

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:42.040
without mentioning blonde 
tokusatsu actress Peggy Neal.

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:44.040
We've gone from fishmen to blondes.

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:44.850
Someone stop her.

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:45.750
Just leave her be.

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:47.970
Oh, Miss Peggy Neal.

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:51.100
You were beautiful in 
<i>The X from Outer Space</i>, as well.

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:53.200
By the way, director Hajime Sato

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:55.890
also produced the masterpiece 
<i>Goke, Body Snatcher from Hell</i>.

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:57.710
Body snatcher, huh?

00:13:57.710 --> 00:14:02.490
Then perhaps it wouldn't be so strange 
if Nami were kidnapped by a fishman.

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:03.810
What do you mean?

00:14:03.810 --> 00:14:05.580
Think about it.

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:09.830
We're already involved 
with a vampire named Mai.

00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:11.570
This is fate.

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:14.610
Perhaps these two non-human creatures 
seek to meet each other.

00:14:14.610 --> 00:14:17.290
What is this if not fate?

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:18.800
That's ridiculous.

00:14:18.800 --> 00:14:20.430
Call it whatever you want.

00:14:20.430 --> 00:14:23.500
This story has been 
ridiculous from the start.

00:14:23.870 --> 00:14:26.850
Regardless of the reason, 
we need to save Nami.

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:29.410
She's got a foul mouth, 
but she's still beautiful.

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:31.660
And she's definitely a woman.

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:34.120
We'll have to recapture her.

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:35.970
It's the only thing to do.

00:14:36.260 --> 00:14:40.980
Yeah!

00:14:43.830 --> 00:14:49.040
Fishman, fishman, fishman!

00:14:49.510 --> 00:14:52.120
This 4K camera is impressive.

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:54.360
The image remains smooth even 
while using the digital zoom.

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:57.220
Anyway, he still hasn't shown up.

00:14:57.220 --> 00:14:59.370
Maybe our bait isn't attractive enough.

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:02.310
Fishmen love beautiful women.

00:15:02.310 --> 00:15:05.800
Which means a fishman wouldn't 
kidnap another fishman.

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:07.430
We'll have to use...

00:15:07.430 --> 00:15:11.210
Unfortunately, I'm obligated 
to document this event.

00:15:11.210 --> 00:15:12.360
Nobody asked you.

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:16.260
I doubt the fishman would get turned 
on by Jinko in her school swimsuit.

00:15:16.260 --> 00:15:19.760
I may be beautiful, 
but I'm not a young girl.

00:15:19.760 --> 00:15:22.790
In Hollywood movies, they like blondes.

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:24.610
Which means...

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:29.420
No! Absolutely not Mai!

00:15:29.700 --> 00:15:32.230
Not a problem. No problemo.

00:15:32.230 --> 00:15:33.000
Mai.

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:35.920
This is for Nami.

00:15:35.920 --> 00:15:39.400
And besides, the fishman is half human.

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:41.760
A vampire and a fishman.

00:15:41.760 --> 00:15:44.430
If we speak to each other 
as humanoid minorities,

00:15:44.430 --> 00:15:46.060
I'm sure we can come to an understanding.

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:47.500
That doesn't make any sense.

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:52.380
Well spoken. Come on, let's do 
this before she changes her mind.

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:53.510
Yeah!

00:16:02.150 --> 00:16:04.180
Good! So good!

00:16:04.180 --> 00:16:05.080
It's too much!

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:06.830
My nose won't stop bleeding!

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:09.250
Looks like I'm needed.

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:12.730
I, Perseus Katsuno, shall protect Mai.

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:17.440
Mai's Andromeda is captivating, 
but her cosplay isn't revealing enough.

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:22.750
We had to self-censor ourselves 
due to rating issues.

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:26.100
How can you guys be this 
laid-back during an emergency?

00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:26.590
He's coming.

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:28.500
What? He's already here?

00:16:30.770 --> 00:16:31.770
He came immediately.

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:32.610
He's on his way.

00:16:32.610 --> 00:16:34.130
He came in the blink of an eye.

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:38.490
As expected, he couldn't 
resist Mai's charms.

00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:41.930
Fishmen are so easy to read.

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:43.560
This kind of stings.

00:16:43.860 --> 00:16:44.550
Huh?

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:53.910
It's not that he's not scary-looking.

00:16:53.910 --> 00:16:55.070
He just looks stupid, too.

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:56.610
And creepy.

00:16:56.610 --> 00:16:59.510
Well, he certainly is half-man.

00:16:59.510 --> 00:17:00.670
This is awful.

00:17:00.670 --> 00:17:03.290
Regardless, he's definitely a monster.

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:05.260
Out of the way!

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:12.790
I'll kill you, you fish bastard!

00:17:21.490 --> 00:17:23.470
I knew that would happen.

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:25.560
It didn't work.

00:17:30.350 --> 00:17:31.590
Mai is in danger!

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:35.300
Wait. If the captain can't beat him, 
there's no way an ordinary human can.

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:37.870
We'll have to unleash Franken!

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:40.030
But he's still charging!

00:17:44.470 --> 00:17:46.910
He's 80% charged.

00:17:46.910 --> 00:17:48.390
This is an emergency.

00:17:48.390 --> 00:17:50.390
Franken, activate!

00:17:50.390 --> 00:17:51.730
Save Mai!

00:17:51.730 --> 00:17:54.990
If he's not fully charged, 
he might start decomposing.

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:58.670
And that would be a really rotten time.

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:08.150
Mai!

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:09.900
<b>Franken 88
AV Plus/Hulk Mode</b>

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:11.330
Go, Franken!

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:12.500
Kill him!

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:14.850
Burn the whole world down!

00:18:14.850 --> 00:18:18.940
Nice. Frankenstein versus the giant fishman.

00:18:18.940 --> 00:18:20.860
I haven't shot action like this in a while!

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:37.800
<b>Fishy VS Franken</b>

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:37.800
<b>Battle of the Southern Seas</b>

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:37.800
<b>What is the beautiful girl's fate!?</b>

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:37.800
<b>Two huge monsters clash!!</b>

00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:29.590
<i>It was a magnificent battle.</i>

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:33.610
<i>Who would win? His obsession for the 
beautiful girl, or the power of love?</i>

00:18:33.610 --> 00:18:37.790
<i>Their battle was finally 
approaching its conclusion.</i>

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:53.560
Uh-oh. He ran out of batteries.

00:18:53.560 --> 00:18:55.690
We'll have to launch an all out attack.

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:57.480
Get him, everyone!

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:00.950
Good! That's it!

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:06.950
<b>Self-censored</b>

00:19:10.640 --> 00:19:12.320
Take this!

00:19:17.930 --> 00:19:21.300
<i>And thus, our deadly night ended.</i>

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:24.260
Fishy!

00:19:27.230 --> 00:19:29.150
Oh, Fishy.

00:19:29.150 --> 00:19:32.130
Huh? What's wrong, ma'am?

00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:33.730
What's wrong?

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:37.660
You're the ones who beat 
up my precious Fishy!

00:19:37.660 --> 00:19:43.710
Ma'am, who was that girl who was kidnapped 
by this fishman 500 years ago?

00:19:46.350 --> 00:19:47.960
It was me.

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:53.960
<b>Censored</b>

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:58.960
<b>Censored</b>

00:20:01.940 --> 00:20:05.170
But you said she was a beautiful girl.

00:20:05.170 --> 00:20:07.620
That she received countless 
marriage proposals.

00:20:07.620 --> 00:20:10.860
I told you, I turned down those 
countless marriage proposals

00:20:10.860 --> 00:20:14.900
and gave my heart and soul to Fishy!

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:16.350
What is this old hag into?

00:20:16.350 --> 00:20:19.610
And how has she been alive for 500 years?

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:23.320
They say consuming the flesh of 
a merman grants you immortality.

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:26.710
Instead of Yao Bikuni's 800 year old 
priestess, she's an 800 year old hag.

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:29.620
<b>Yao Bikuni
(800-year-old Priestess)</b>

00:20:26.980 --> 00:20:28.890
Ah, I see.

00:20:28.140 --> 00:20:30.250
So that's how it is.

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:30.250
<b>800-year-old Hag</b>

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:32.930
It's a cross-species romance!

00:20:32.930 --> 00:20:35.150
Don't act like you did anything to help.

00:20:35.150 --> 00:20:38.390
But ma'am, why do you sacrifice 
young girls to him?

00:20:38.390 --> 00:20:43.870
Lately, Fishy hasn't been showing 
up, no matter how much I call him.

00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:45.610
Lately?

00:20:45.610 --> 00:20:49.140
Since about 480 years ago.

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:50.260
Makes sense to me.

00:20:50.260 --> 00:20:52.000
Men are the worst.

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:55.780
Regardless, I'm glad Mai is all right.

00:20:55.780 --> 00:20:56.930
What are you talking about?

00:20:56.930 --> 00:20:58.850
Nami is still missing.

00:20:58.850 --> 00:21:00.270
Oh, I forgot.

00:21:00.270 --> 00:21:03.230
Did he eat her?

00:21:03.230 --> 00:21:04.950
How dare you?!

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:08.180
Fishy isn't a savage fishman!

00:21:08.180 --> 00:21:10.280
Then where's Nami?

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:14.370
<b>Self-censored</b>

00:21:13.530 --> 00:21:15.010
Whew.

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:16.290
<b>Self-censored</b>

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:25.180
<b>Self-censored</b>

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:19.710
Boy, that was tough.

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:22.680
This guy's stomach stinks.

00:21:22.680 --> 00:21:24.570
I wonder if he's got gastroxynsis.

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:36.150
<b>Self-censored</b>

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:27.450
Nami, you're alive.

00:21:26.820 --> 00:21:36.150
Naked! Naked! Naked!

00:21:27.450 --> 00:21:29.980
Yeah. I'm back.

00:21:29.980 --> 00:21:32.270
Truly a fisherman's daughter.

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:34.800
I can't believe she made it 
back from a fishman's stomach.

00:21:34.800 --> 00:21:36.150
She's got guts.

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:50.030
<b>Self-censored</b>

00:21:44.350 --> 00:21:49.340
<i>Amidst a whirlpool of 
emotion, our battle ended.</i>

00:21:50.880 --> 00:21:56.670
<i>Having recovered thanks to his horrifying 
vitality, the fishman returned to the sea.</i>

00:21:58.680 --> 00:22:02.560
<i>Back to the world where he lived, 
at the bottom of the ocean.</i>

00:22:02.970 --> 00:22:06.100
<i>Back to his soul's homeland.</i>

00:22:09.260 --> 00:22:14.980
<b>Fin</b>

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:59.990
<b>Episode 12 "Interview With Mai"</b>

00:23:45.930 --> 00:23:49.150
In order to minimize information leaks,

00:23:49.150 --> 00:23:53.130
on the condition that even our blood 
brothers and sisters would be excluded,

00:23:53.610 --> 00:23:57.870
I agreed to help Maki make her movie.
